## MVP finish line

Consider version 1 **done** when you can:

* [ ] Start the application
* [ ] View your facility
* [ ] Create rooms
* [ ] Create strains
* [ ] Create a plant batch
* [ ] Put the batch into a room
* [ ] See its strain and plant count
* [ ] See how many days it has been there
* [ ] Create tasks
* [ ] Complete tasks
* [ ] Move the batch into another room
* [ ] Retain its previous room history
* [ ] Move it through Clone → Veg → Flower → Dry
* [ ] Harvest the batch
* [ ] View the completed batch afterward

Once all of those work, **stop adding features and call the MVP finished.**



